{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/c8c3f57b51efedf3e2657d716b78768e.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/724afbd721cd7ddc26f9ced8c1fab2e6.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height=441 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure calls, Captain! Explore a world of endless blue, where every wave brings new treasures, battles, and, most importantly, adorable crewmates waiting to join your fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/c3ab62d8f652657f70a59d3e1aaf25b0.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/6102b8df4a3d92b9a0dd6676acbaa2ba.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height=441 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70+ gorgeous girls are ready to sail by your side, each with unique looks, skills, and stories. Collect them through gacha summons, strengthen your squad, and build the cutest crew on the seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/38c090923a2b4757e4fdad4f24ceda75.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height=441 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more lonely voyages! Grow closer to your favorite waifus through exclusive stories and hot spring dates. As your bonds grow, so do their powers, making every adventure sweeter and every battle brighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/ae670540176e8bb5f034ccd90ed1411c.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge rival captains and engage in fun minigames like puzzles, trial tower, and horse races. Win battles, earn rewards, and watch your girls shine as you chase the legendary Blue Pearl!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957240?t=1772022577","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/24765e57e01595251fad324af150d9d09a6eb9f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772022577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/571742d3e8faae2329169f866538860f5dfabfe1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772022577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/571742d3e8faae2329169f866538860f5dfabfe1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772022577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains themes that might not be suitable for all ages.\r\n- revealing outfits\r\n- cartoon violence\r\n- mild crude language"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957240/extras/c8c3f57b51efedf3e2657d716b78768e.avif?t=1772022577\" width=615 height